            <id>2122</id>
            <title>
              <key>en</key>
              <value>Do not apply 67-FZ regulation when revaluating debt</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>fa</key>
              <value>عدم اعمال مقررات 67-FZ هنگام تجدید ارزیابی بدهی</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>ru</key>
              <value>При переоценке задолженности не применять положения 67-ФЗ</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>tr</key>
              <value>Borcu yeniden değerleme esnasında 67-FK hükümlerini uygulamayın</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>vi</key>
              <value>Khi đánh giá lại công nợ, không áp dụng điều khoản 67-FZ</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>it</key>
              <value>Do not apply 67-FZ regulation when revaluating debt</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>pl</key>
              <value>Do not apply 67-FZ regulation when revaluating debt</value>
            </title>
            <visible>true</visible>
            <enabled>true</enabled>
