      <items xsi:type="form:FormGroup">
        <name>LocalizationGroupOrderOfReflectionOfUnfacturedDeliveriesTA</name>
        <id>1076</id>
        <items xsi:type="form:FormField">
          <name>ProcedureForReflectingUnfacturedDeliveriesUponReceipt</name>
          <id>1081</id>
          <visible>true</visible>
          <enabled>true</enabled>
          <userVisible>
            <common>true</common>
          </userVisible>
          <dataPath xsi:type="form:DataPath">
            <segments>Object.ProcedureToRecordUninvoicedDeliveriesTA</segments>
          </dataPath>
          <titleLocation>None</titleLocation>
          <shortcut>Ctrl+S</shortcut>
          <toolTip>
            <key>en</key>
            <value>Receipt cost is recorded in TA and can be accounted for in expenses upon goods outflow from the warehouse.
We recommend that you use it if invoice entry is carried out in the same fiscal period as the receipt.</value>
          </toolTip>
          <toolTip>
            <key>fa</key>
            <value>بهای دریافت در حسابداری مالیاتی ثبت می‌شود و می‌تواند هنگام خروج کالا از انبار در هزینه‌ها منظور شود.
توصیه می‌کنیم در صورتی که ورود فاکتور در همان دوره مالی دریافت انجام می‌شود، از این گزینه استفاده کنید.</value>
          </toolTip>
          <toolTip>
            <key>ru</key>
            <value>Стоимость поступления отражается в НУ и может быть учтена в расходах при выбытии товаров со склада.
Рекомендуется использовать, если фактуровка произойдет в том же налоговом периоде, что и поступление.</value>
          </toolTip>
          <toolTip>
            <key>tr</key>
            <value>Makbuzun maliyeti VM'ye kaydedilir ve mallar depodan çıktığında giderleştirilebilir.
 Faturalamanın makbuzla aynı vergi döneminde gerçekleşmesi durumunda kullanılması önerilmektedir.</value>
          </toolTip>
          <toolTip>
            <key>vi</key>
            <value>Giá trị tiếp nhận được phản ánh vào KTTh và có thể được tính vào chi phí khi thanh lý hàng hóa từ kho.
Nên sử dụng, nếu lập hóa đơn trong cùng kỳ thuế với tiếp nhận.</value>
          </toolTip>
          <toolTip>
            <key>it</key>
            <value>Receipt cost is recorded in TA and can be accounted for in expenses upon goods outflow from the warehouse.
We recommend that you use it if invoice entry is carried out in the same fiscal period as the receipt.</value>
          </toolTip>
          <toolTip>
            <key>pl</key>
            <value>Receipt cost is recorded in TA and can be accounted for in expenses upon goods outflow from the warehouse.
We recommend that you use it if invoice entry is carried out in the same fiscal period as the receipt.</value>
          </toolTip>
          <toolTipRepresentation>Button</toolTipRepresentation>
          <extendedTooltip>
            <name>ProcedureForReflectingUnfacturedDeliveriesUponReceiptExtendedTooltip</name>
            <id>1083</id>
            <type>Label</type>
            <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
            <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
            <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
              <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
            </extInfo>
          </extendedTooltip>
          <contextMenu>
            <name>ProcedureForReflectingUnfacturedDeliveriesUponReceiptContextMenu</name>
            <id>1082</id>
            <autoFill>true</autoFill>
          </contextMenu>
          <type>RadioButtonField</type>
          <editMode>Enter</editMode>
          <showInHeader>true</showInHeader>
          <headerHorizontalAlign>Left</headerHorizontalAlign>
          <showInFooter>true</showInFooter>
          <extInfo xsi:type="form:RadioButtonsFieldExtInfo">
            <columnsCount>1</columnsCount>
            <choiceList>
              <presentation>
                <key>en</key>
                <value>Record on receipt</value>
              </presentation>
              <presentation>
                <key>fa</key>
                <value>ثبت هنگام دریافت</value>
              </presentation>
              <presentation>
                <key>ru</key>
                <value>Отражать при поступлении</value>
              </presentation>
              <presentation>
                <key>tr</key>
                <value>Makbuza yansıtın</value>
              </presentation>
              <presentation>
                <key>vi</key>
                <value>Hiển thị khi tiếp nhận</value>
              </presentation>
              <presentation>
                <key>it</key>
                <value>Record on receipt</value>
              </presentation>
              <presentation>
                <key>pl</key>
                <value>Record on receipt</value>
              </presentation>
              <value xsi:type="core:ReferenceValue">
                <value>Enum.OptionsToRecordUninvoicedDeliveriesTA.EnumValue.RecordOnReceipt</value>
              </value>
            </choiceList>
          </extInfo>
        </items>
        <items xsi:type="form:FormField">
          <name>ProcedureForReflectingUnfacturedDeliveriesDuringInvoicing</name>
          <id>1078</id>
          <visible>true</visible>
          <enabled>true</enabled>
          <userVisible>
            <common>true</common>
          </userVisible>
          <dataPath xsi:type="form:DataPath">
            <segments>Object.ProcedureToRecordUninvoicedDeliveriesTA</segments>
          </dataPath>
          <titleLocation>None</titleLocation>
          <shortcut>Ctrl+S</shortcut>
          <toolTip>
            <key>en</key>
            <value>The cost of invoiced goods in TA is allocated between the remaining item lot in the warehouse and the goods outflow. The cost of the goods outflow is written off as other expenses (account 91).
We recommend that you use it if fiscal periods of the receipt and invoice entry are different.</value>
          </toolTip>
          <toolTip>
            <key>fa</key>
            <value>بهای کالاهای فاکتورشده در حسابداری مالیاتی بین بچ باقیمانده قلم در انبار و خروج کالا تسهیم می‌شود. بهای خروج کالا به عنوان سایر هزینه‌ها (حساب 91) اسقاط می‌شود.
توصیه می‌کنیم در صورتی که دوره‌های مالی دریافت و ورود فاکتور متفاوت هستند، از این گزینه استفاده کنید.</value>
          </toolTip>
          <toolTip>
            <key>ru</key>
            <value>Стоимость отфактурованных товаров в НУ распределяется между остатком партии товаров на складе и выбытием товаров. Стоимость, которая относится к выбывшим со склада товарам, списывается на прочие расходы (счет 91).
Рекомендуется использовать, если налоговые периоды поступления и фактуровки могут не совпадать.</value>
          </toolTip>
          <toolTip>
            <key>tr</key>
            <value>Vergi muhasebesindeki faturalanmış malların maliyeti, stoktaki malların sevkiyat bakiyesi ile malların elden çıkarılması arasında paylaştırılır. Depodan elden çıkarılan mallara atfedilen maliyet diğer giderlere (hesap 91) yazılır.
 Fiş ve faturalama vergi dönemlerinin çakışmaması durumunda kullanılması önerilmektedir.</value>
          </toolTip>
          <toolTip>
            <key>vi</key>
            <value>Giá trị hàng hóa chưa lập hóa đơn trong KTTh được phân bổ giữa số dư lô hàng trong kho và thanh lý hàng hóa. Giá trị liên quan đến hàng hóa thanh lý từ kho được ghi giảm vào chi phí khác (tài khoản 811).
Nên sử dụng, nếu kỳ thuế tiếp nhận và lập hóa đơn có thể không trùng nhau.</value>
          </toolTip>
          <toolTip>
            <key>it</key>
            <value>The cost of invoiced goods in TA is allocated between the remaining item lot in the warehouse and the goods outflow. The cost of the goods outflow is written off as other expenses (account 91).
We recommend that you use it if fiscal periods of the receipt and invoice entry are different.</value>
          </toolTip>
          <toolTip>
            <key>pl</key>
            <value>The cost of invoiced goods in TA is allocated between the remaining item lot in the warehouse and the goods outflow. The cost of the goods outflow is written off as other expenses (account 91).
We recommend that you use it if fiscal periods of the receipt and invoice entry are different.</value>
          </toolTip>
          <toolTipRepresentation>Button</toolTipRepresentation>
          <extendedTooltip>
            <name>ProcedureForReflectingUnfacturedDeliveriesDuringInvoicingExtendedTooltip</name>
            <id>1080</id>
            <type>Label</type>
            <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
            <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
            <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
              <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
            </extInfo>
          </extendedTooltip>
          <contextMenu>
            <name>ProcedureForReflectingUnfacturedDeliveriesDuringInvoicingContextMenu</name>
            <id>1079</id>
            <autoFill>true</autoFill>
          </contextMenu>
          <type>RadioButtonField</type>
          <editMode>Enter</editMode>
          <showInHeader>true</showInHeader>
          <headerHorizontalAlign>Left</headerHorizontalAlign>
          <showInFooter>true</showInFooter>
          <extInfo xsi:type="form:RadioButtonsFieldExtInfo">
            <columnsCount>1</columnsCount>
            <choiceList>
              <presentation>
                <key>en</key>
                <value>Record on invoice entry</value>
              </presentation>
              <presentation>
                <key>fa</key>
                <value>ثبت هنگام ورود فاکتور</value>
              </presentation>
              <presentation>
                <key>ru</key>
                <value>Отражать при фактуровке</value>
              </presentation>
              <presentation>
                <key>tr</key>
                <value>Faturalandırmaya yansıtın</value>
              </presentation>
              <presentation>
                <key>vi</key>
                <value>Phản ánh khi tạo hóa đơn</value>
              </presentation>
              <presentation>
                <key>it</key>
                <value>Record on invoice entry</value>
              </presentation>
              <presentation>
                <key>pl</key>
                <value>Record on invoice entry</value>
              </presentation>
              <value xsi:type="core:ReferenceValue">
                <value>Enum.OptionsToRecordUninvoicedDeliveriesTA.EnumValue.RecordOnInvoiceEntry</value>
              </value>
            </choiceList>
          </extInfo>
        </items>
